"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"¥0.157，比常规 200G 档贵 25%"}]}],["$","$1","21",{"children":"；只有 300G 特惠的 ¥0.108 是真便宜。两档按量不限时包每 GB ¥0.43 / ¥0.79，是月付档的 "}],["$","$1","22",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"3.4～6.3 倍"}]}],["$","$1","23",{"children":"。三条读者要先知道的事："}],["$","$1","24",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"①它的匿名接口全部关闭，不注册登录看不到价目表"}]}],["$","$1","25",{"children":"，所以网上流传的大讯云价格全是旧的；"}],["$","$1","26",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"②站内公告用「中国最新红头文件严厉打击」「几乎所有机场都崩溃了」开头推销自家客户端"}]}],["$","$1","27",{"children":"，这是话术不是技术事实；"}],["$","$1","28",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":["③搜索引擎和多个导航站至今把 ",["$","code",null,{"className":"border border-rule bg-card px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] text-accent","children":"daxuns.top"}]," 当官网，而它现在是一个写着「可能出售」的停放页"]}]}],["$","$1","29",{"children":"——能用的入口本站实测有五个，见下文。"}],["$","$1","30",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"节点、速度、线路类型、流媒体解锁，本文一律未实测、一律不认领。"}]}]]}],"\n"]}]
